  "readmeFile": "docs\\README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Features:\n  - Create searchable PDFs from OCR photo results - supports ReadPhoto, ReadScreenShot, and ReadDocumentAdvanced\n\n  Bug Fixes:\n  - Fixed an issue where corrupted characters from the input Pdf appeared in the output searchable Pdf\n  - Fixed an issue where SaveAsSearchablePdf() throws exception when applying Deskew() to OcrInput\n  - Fixed an issue where SaveAsSearchablePdf() throws exception when ApplyFilter was set to true\n\n  Known Limitations:\n  - Scale() and EnhanceResolution() filters are not supported with SaveAsSearchablePdf() when ApplyFilter is enabled. All other filters work correctly.\n\n  Updates:\n  - Updates internal dependencies.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "The OCR Library for C# & VB.Net.  Highly optimized Tesseract 5 OCR in a stand-alone .NET library.\n\n      Converts scanned documents, images, and PDFs to plain text.  Also detects barcodes and QR.",
  "title": "IronOcr for MacOs - The Cutting Edge C# OCR Library",
